/TU (Diagram showing four input parameters to the FluidHamrony method and multiple processing modules. User-defined cardinalities define the number of elements in the pcset combinations. Pcset Fourier magnitude and phase distance to the reference pcset are combined to compute a harmonic stability indicator. The user defines the balance between the two metrics. Pcsets with higher harmonic stability are included in the lexicon.)
